  "step_3": "The decision reason requires evaluating the sum of pairwise differences in outcomes. The individual did not consider any such calculation or comparison of outcome differences. Instead, the individual justified the choice based on the certainty of the outcome in A. Therefore, the information relevant to the decision reason (the sum of pairwise outcome differences) was not considered. Additionally, the individual’s justification (certainty of gain) does not align with the rule of the decision reason (preferring the lottery with the more favorable sum of outcome differences). Since the individual neither considered the pairwise outcome differences nor applied the rule of the reason, the decision reason was not used.",
