  "step_3": "The decision reason requires considering the sum of all pairwise differences of outcomes between the lotteries and preferring the one with the more favorable sum. In this case, both lotteries have the same sum of absolute pairwise differences (8000), so the reason would be indifferent. However, the individual does not mention this sum or any such calculation. Instead, the individual justifies the choice based on the higher potential prize in Lottery A, which is a different reasoning principle (maximizing the maximum outcome). The individual does not reference pairwise differences or their sum. Therefore, the decision reason was not used. The justification is based on a different criterion (maximum outcome), not on the sum of pairwise differences. Thus, the individual did not use the specified decision reason.",
